STEP 9: Dilaton Family Re-Test at L_max=7
==============================================================================

  Dilaton family: f(x; phi) = -ln(1 + phi*x)
  ALGEBRAIC FACT: f(0) = -ln(1) = 0 for ALL phi, independent of L_max.
  Therefore m_H(dilaton) = mH_ref * sqrt(f(0)) = 0 at ANY L_max.
  This is an algebraic theorem, NOT subject to L_max correction.

